... correction no need to merge the columns, but the extEpochData_timeformat parameter is not correctly specified.

Further, it is unclear from your message how you can have count data for raw .bin files. GENEActiv does not generate count data that GGIR facilitate. What sensor brand are you working with, is it any of the ones specified: in https://wadpac.github.io/GGIR/articles/chapter2_Pipeline.html#externally-derived-epoch-level-data?

Thanks,

Vincent

