Thank you for your response Vincent,
I have converted our raw GENEActiv data to count data using the code documented here: https://github.com/btlindert/actant-1/blob/master/formats/genea2epochs.m. Then I have written some in-house code to create a similar structure as the Actiwatch_csv so that it can be compatible with GGIR. The reason I had to do this is because half our dataset used the historic Philips actiwatches and the other half uses GENEActiv.

Kind Regards,
Aaron

