Hey - would you be able to share your sleep log? The primary error probably still lies there (e.g.,  https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues/89), so you might try viewing your sleeplog in a plain text editor like Notepad, Sublime Text, etc. Excel (if you happen to be using) may hide something within the CSV that is breaking things when read through into GGIR.

The "Skipping files" error occurs because your sleeplog CSV is located within your data folder.

