... another issue with your sleeplog is that you have several values that are not timestamps. For example 2200, 6.15, 23.25 and 1010. Please manually check your sleeplog for correct timestamp values, GGIR cannot fix these errors.

In the next GGIR release it will generate a more informative error message.
Best,
Vincent

