Glad to hear you managed to solve the issue. The only folder it cannot be stored inis Geneactiv > Data or any of the subfolders of Data, because GGIR looks for accelerometer files on all those subfolders.

It should be fine to store it in Geneactiv -> Results if that is what you specify as parameter outputdir.

Anyway, good you got it to work.
Best,
Vincent

